<title>USA: Tesoro Petroleum Corp Q1 EPS flat.</title>
<headline>Tesoro Petroleum Corp Q1 EPS flat.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						    Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							  March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	1996</p>
<p>  Revenues					 $234.9   $243.6</p>
<p>  Net						   6.1	6.0</p>
<p>Average Outstanding Common &amp;</p>
<p>    Common Equivalent Shares		   26.8     25.7</p>
<p>  Net Earnings Per Share			  .23	.23</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said previous Q1 includes a charge of $2.3 million for costs of a shareholder consent solicitation that was resolved in April 1996.</p>
<p>The company said Q1 for both 1997 and 1996 includes gains of $1.6 million and $5.0 million, respectively, from retroactive severance tax refunds.</p>
</text>
